}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{"schema_version":"world-substrate-causal-model/v0","mechanics":[{"schema_version":"world-substrate-action-mechanic/v0","mechanic_id":"schedule-regular-meetings","version":"1","action_kind":"schedule-regular-meetings","rationale":"The represented work cycle holds a recurring interval and countdown, so scheduling updates those fields. Restricting this action to the Partnership and a positive, changed cadence avoids inventing a separate schedule record.","actor_selector":{"categories":["actor","member"],"components":["member","location","work"]},"participants":{"decision":{"categories":["work-cycle"],"components":["moment","location"]}},"parameters":{"cadence_ticks":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},"checks":[{"label":"Only the Partnership may set this meeting schedule","left":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"components.member.role"}},"op":"eq","right":{"literal":"Partnership of four countries considering activation of the system"}},{"label":"The meeting interval must be positive","left":{"action_field":"cadence_ticks"},"op":"gt","right":{"literal":0}},{"label":"The new interval must differ from the current one","left":{"action_field":"cadence_ticks"},"op":"ne","right":{"participant":{"name":"decision","path":"components.moment.every_ticks"}}},{"label":"The Partnership and meeting cycle must be in the same place","left":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"location.location_id"}},"op":"eq","right":{"participant":{"name":"decision","path":"location.location_id"}}}],"effects":[{"participant":"decision","path":"components.moment.every_ticks","op":"set","value":{"action_field":"cadence_ticks"}},{"participant":"decision","path":"components.moment.ticks_until","op":"set","value":{"action_field":"cadence_ticks"}}],"limits":["The decision reference for this action must identify the represented work cycle; this records its interval, not meeting attendance or outcomes.","The cadence is limited to the listed positive values. The countdown restarts